    "_comment": "A 101/102-key PC keyboard, the mouse buttons and two gameport sticks. Well past 64 buttons, so every button rides SetButton and the packed mask is unioned with it. The order here is generated from waterbox/pcem-input.c, which holds the scancode for each.",
